<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <%- include('../partials/head', { meta: meta, currentPage: 'about' }) %>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('../partials/header', { currentPage: 'about' }) %>
    
    <div class="hero">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>About The Vulnerable MCP Project</h1>
            <p>Learn about our mission, goals, and how you can contribute</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <main class="container" id="main-content">
        <section class="about-section">
            <h2>Our Mission</h2>
            <p>The Vulnerable MCP Project is a community-maintained database that tracks known vulnerabilities, limitations, and security concerns with the Model Context Protocol (MCP). Our mission is to help developers, security researchers, and organizations understand and mitigate the risks associated with implementing MCP in their AI systems.</p>
            <p>Model Context Protocol (MCP) enables AI systems to access tools and external resources, but this capability introduces new security challenges. By documenting these vulnerabilities, we aim to promote safer implementation practices and contribute to the overall security of AI systems.</p>
        </section>
        
        <section class="about-section">
            <h2>Key Features</h2>
            <div class="about-features">
                <div class="feature">
                    <h3>Community-Driven</h3>
                    <p>This project relies on contributions from security researchers, AI developers, and the broader tech community.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature">
                    <h3>Regularly Updated</h3>
                    <p>New vulnerabilities and mitigation strategies are added as they are discovered and verified.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature">
                    <h3>Open Source</h3>
                    <p>All content is freely available and can be contributed to via our GitHub repository.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        
        <section class="about-section">
            <h2>How to Contribute</h2>
            <p>We welcome contributions from the community to help make this resource more comprehensive and valuable. Here's how you can contribute:</p>
            <ul style="margin-left: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                <li>Submit new vulnerabilities or update existing ones</li>
                <li>Improve documentation and descriptions</li>
                <li>Add mitigation strategies and best practices</li>
                <li>Report bugs or suggest improvements to the website</li>
            </ul>
            <p>To contribute, please visit our <a href="https://github.com/vineethsai/vulnerablemcp" style="color: var(--primary-color);">GitHub repository</a> and submit a pull request or open an issue.</p>
        </section>
    </main>
    
    <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
